# Project Registry

List of registered projects. Auto-registered by kaizen-init-project, synced by kaizen-update-docs.

**Important**: This file is auto-updated by commands. Manual editing is not recommended.

Full project summaries are available in `details/{project-id}.md`, synced by kaizen-update-docs.

Project lessons (synced from each project's `docs/LEARNINGS.md`) are in `learnings/{project-id}.md`, also synced by kaizen-update-docs and used as input by `/kaizen-audit-knowledge`'s cross-project pass.

